[b]Bottleneck Heatmap - 1.1.2[/b]
Real-time visual diagnostic heatmap for Kingdom Inc workshops. Color-codes all workshop nodes and connecting pipes with semi-transparent overlays to instantly identify running lines, starved machines, clogged bottlenecks, and full storage containers.

[b]Features[/b]
[list]
[*]Transparent Overlays: Preserves full readability of node icons, recipe cards, progress bars, ports, and pipe routes without visual occlusion.
[*]Node & Pipe State Evaluation:
  - [b]🟢 Running (Mint Green):[/b] Actively processing recipes, producing resources, or transferring items through pipes.
  - [b]🟡 Starved (Golden Amber):[/b] Missing required recipe reagents, unfulfilled resource quotas, or pipes waiting for items from upstream.
  - [b]🔴 Clogged (Crimson Coral):[/b] Downstream output buffer full, item rejected, or jammed pipe connections.
  - [b]🟣 Full Storage (Royal Purple):[/b] Storage containers (Stockpiles and global Armories) that have reached maximum capacity.
  - [b]⚪ Idle (Slate):[/b] Unconfigured recipes, dormant machines, or empty/dead pipe branches.
[*]Instant Hotkey Toggle: Press [b]H[/b] (or customize to any key) at any time to toggle the heatmap on or off.
[*]Foundation Integration:
  - Adds a styled [b]Heatmap: ON / OFF[/b] toggle button directly onto the in-game [b]Mod Bar[/b], perfectly aligned with the top HUD without ellipsis or truncation.
  - Full [b]Mod Config[/b] menu: customize your Toggle Hotkey, adjust color palettes for all 5 states, configure node and pipe opacities, tune pipe glow width, toggle idle elements, and configure notification toasts.
[*]Zero Save Footprint: Visual-only runtime diagnostic; does not alter save files, recipe formulas, or vanilla mechanics.
[/list]

[b]Requirements[/b]
Kingdom Inc for Windows x64 (Mono).
BepInEx 5 (5.4.21 or later, Windows x64 Mono):
https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx/releases/tag/v5.4.23.6
Foundation (0.5.0 or later, recommended for Mod Bar and Mod Config):
https://www.nexusmods.com/kingdominc/mods/18

[b]Installation[/b]
1. Install BepInEx 5 (and optionally Foundation).
2. Close Kingdom Inc if it is running.
3. Extract the release ZIP into your game directory so [i]BottleneckHeatmap.dll[/i] is located at [i]BepInEx/plugins/BottleneckHeatmap/BottleneckHeatmap.dll[/i].
4. Launch Kingdom Inc and open any workshop flow diagram. Press [b]H[/b] or click the [b]Heatmap[/b] button on the Mod Bar to inspect your factory!

[b]Hotkeys[/b]
[list]
[*][b]H[/b] — Toggle Bottleneck Heatmap overlay.
[/list]

[b]Compatibility and known issues[/b]
Client-side visual diagnostic tool. Does not modify player save data or game logic. Safe to install or remove at any time without affecting existing saves. Tested on Windows 10/11 x64.

[b]Removal[/b]
Close Kingdom Inc and delete the [i]BepInEx/plugins/BottleneckHeatmap[/i] folder.

